;    0: TWdLink(count=770, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Brutal.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "222" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Kill the humans...? If you do that, you won't be able to reproduce anymore."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's exactly why I say you're fools. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Humans really are self-centered creatures. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So let me ask you. How long do you think I've been here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I've been here for thousands, tens of thousands of years. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But humans came only about 700 years ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So how did I reproduce until then?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Surely not..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Exactly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Humans think they are the lords of all creation, and it never occurs to them to stand on equal footing with other living things. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Heh heh heh. </STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1">'ve only got that much intelligence too, after all."</STYLE><PG>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Now then, it would be a hassle if anyone saw this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Kikyo<STYLE ID="1">, goodbye."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "111" "$000080" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> words were the last I heard, and my consciousness began rapidly to wear away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">As my consciousness slipped away, I understood the meaning of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ko-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> words.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">My thinking was―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">naive.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Shigatsu Youka was a creature that could not live without humans.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The moment I believed that, I had already lost.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Humans are not the only thing Shigatsu Youka uses to reproduce.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Bears, deer, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="うさぎ">rabbits</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="きつね">foxes</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="いのしし">boars</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="たぬき">raccoon dogs</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There is no shortage of mammals that can take the place of humans.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Over long years, Shigatsu Youka has taken intelligence from humans.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So it has no more use for humans.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Humans are now nothing but a nuisance to it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">My thinking was―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">naive.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In the end, all I had been doing was exposing the residents to even greater danger.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Someone like me could never have beaten a creature that had lived for thousands of years.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">No...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Not yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It is not over yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">After this, our descendants―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">yes, the people of Arata will surely stand up to Shigatsu Youka.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I left the clues for them in the storehouse's books.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">It truly pains me that I could not write the final part.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But people more capable and braver than I am will surely stand up to it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Our descendants, surely―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>You descendants I have not yet seen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Please, destroy Shigatsu Youka.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because that is my―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ko-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">the people of Arata's wish―</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
